ion would be given by the  court they would agree to that but  immediately the court gave its decision  the azimio deputy presidential candidate  mother karua just posted on her twitter  and she said that she respects the court  decision but she does not agree with the  ruling  okay what about people's reaction there  so far if there's been any yet can we  expect to see more stability in the  country  certainly  most of the people had fatigue of of  this electoral process because as you  remember this electoral process began  immediately after the 2017 general  election so people are already tired  they wanted to move on you could hear  people say we want this petition to  either be thrown out or the presidency  validated because we are tired with this  electoral cycle but immediately the  decision was announced by the chief  justice in kenya  people in different parts of the country  broke into song and dance and  we shall be keeping a keen eye on  what else will be taking place where  where people are celebrating and we  shall at least try the very least to  bring you thoughts uh as soon as we get  there all right felix thank you very  much for that thorough roundup of  today's events felix moringa for us in  nairobi  you
 

